# sfml-game-lab

C++23 SFML 3.1 game lab. The engine lives in `engine/` (`namespace sgl`). Games live under `games/`: `sgl::arkanoid` (executable `arkanoid`) and `sgl::tetris` (executable `tetris`). Contract: `docs/explanation/architecture.md`. Longer-term notes live in `mvp/` (`01`–`09` prospect, `10` living).

## Stack

- C++23, CMake ≥ 3.20, Ninja presets (`debug` / `release` / `asan` / `coverage`)
- SFML 3.1 via FetchContent (`cmake/FetchSFML.cmake`) — Graphics/Window/System/Audio; Network stays off; no manual SFML install
- GoogleTest 1.18 only in Debug; clang-format / clang-tidy at repo root

## Layout

- `engine/core/` — value types (`sgl_core`)
- `engine/input/` — `InputEvent`, `ActionMap`, `InputState` (`sgl_input`)
- `engine/scene/` — `SceneI`, `SceneStack`, `SceneRequest` (`sgl_scene`)
- `engine/loop/` — `FixedStepLoop`, `App`, `PlatformI`, `ClockI` (`sgl_loop`)
- `engine/render/` — `RenderQueue`, `RendererI` (`sgl_render`)
- `engine/collision/` — sweep / reflect (`sgl_collision`)
- `engine/resources/` — `ResourceCache` (`sgl_resources`)
- `engine/audio/` — `AudioI`, PCM `tone` (`sgl_audio`)
- `engine/fx/` — fixed-capacity particles (`sgl_fx`)
- `engine/save/` — high-score table and atomic text write (`sgl_save`)
- `engine/sfml/` — SFML adapters (`sgl_sfml`); only engine target that links SFML
- `games/arkanoid/sim/` — headless breakout (`arkanoid_sim`)
- `games/arkanoid/app/` — scenes, HUD, sounds, high scores (`arkanoid_app`)
- `games/arkanoid/main.cpp` — executable `arkanoid`
- `games/tetris/sim/` — headless Tetris (`tetris_sim`, links `sgl_core` only)
- `games/tetris/app/` — scenes, board, sounds, high scores (`tetris_app`)
- `games/tetris/main.cpp` — executable `tetris`
- `assets/fonts/` — UI TTF (`ASSET_DIR`). Not `engine/resources/` (that module is the cache)
- `tests/engine/`, `tests/arkanoid/`, `tests/tetris/` — GoogleTest suites (Debug only)
- `tests/mocks/` — `ClockMock`, `PlatformMock`, `RendererMock`, `AudioSpy`

## Build / test

```sh
cmake --preset debug
cmake --build --preset debug --target arkanoid
cmake --build --preset debug --target tetris
cmake --build --preset debug --target build_ut
ctest --preset debug
```

Binaries: `build/<preset>/bin/arkanoid` and `build/<preset>/bin/tetris` (`.exe` on Windows).

## Agent pitfalls

- New `.cpp` files belong in that module’s own `CMakeLists.txt` (`engine/<module>/` or `games/<game>/<sim|app>/`)
- Only `engine/sfml` and `games/<game>/main.cpp` may include SFML; `arkanoid/sim` and `tetris/sim` stay headless
- Tests are headless except `event_translate_test`, which links `SFML::Window` and does not open a window
- Interfaces use the `FooI` suffix (`SceneI`, `RendererI`, `PlatformI`, `ClockI`, `AudioI`)
- Scenes must not `close()` the platform; quit is `QuitApp` / `closeRequested`
- Pause is `RequestPause` when top is `pausable`; overlay is `PauseScene` (`opaque` false)
- Menu cancel is `QuitApp`; overlay cancel is resume (`PopScene`)
- `SceneStack` applies push/pop/replace after the update walk
- Design notes: `mvp/01`–`09` (prospect). Tree names and slices: `mvp/10-engine-progress.md`
